# Allowlist: the build context is the whole workspace root, which also holds
# large unrelated trees (Rust target/, research data, graph outputs). Exclude
# everything, then re-include only the sibling dirs the Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!todl-runtime
!TODL
!Mural
!pragmatic-protocol
!todl-identity
!todl-identity-local
!todl-identity-host
!todl-identity-cloud
!todl-identity-engine
!todl-connectors-host
!todl-platform-node
!todl-platform-cloud
!todl-platform-aws
!todl-platform-azure
!todl-platform-gcp
!todl-identity-node
!pragmatic-server

# Within the allowed dirs: build outputs and local state the image rebuilds or must never carry.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/*.log
**/tests/**/tmp
**/.superpowers
**/coverage
**/.npmrc
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/target
**/graphify-out
pragmatic-server/admin/control-plane/data
# Vendored native sources (Skia etc.) the TS build never reads.
Mural/third_party
